{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56475","headline":"灵草歌 凤青草 · 白云仙人","name":"灵草歌 凤青草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"志道要超昇，须访神草经。\n圣事常宜重，非人莫谩轻。\n恐折人间寿，看似掌中珍。\n欲知庚汞了，须采草凤青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白云仙人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}